 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Check the cable connections, especially the ones on the router. Loose connections can cause drops. Use a cable tester on each cable to find which one drops. Then plug the affected cable into a different port on the router. That's a common one. Ask him to download one game at time, rather than letting the auto update grab them all. It is a bit, but worth it. Also check if he' using a wifi hotspot at school or on social media. That can eat up the band.",
